  "body": "Offering approximately 134.8m² of well-planned living space, this home features quality finishes, contemporary design, and a low-maintenance lifestyle in a highly desirable East Auckland location.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Approx. 134.8m² floor area on a freehold title\r\n• 3 generous double bedrooms, study, including a master ensuite with walk-in wardrobe\r\n• 2.5 fully tiled bathrooms with underfloor heating\r\n• Designer kitchen with granite benchtops and quality appliances\r\n• Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n• Private outdoor courtyard, perfect for entertaining or relaxing\r\n• Internal-access single garage\r\n• Quality finishes throughout with low-maintenance landscaping\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\nIdeally positioned just minutes from Highland Park Shopping Centre, Half Moon Bay Marina, and Botany Town Centre, offering easy access to shopping, cafés, restaurants, and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nTop School Zones:\r\nZoned for:\r\n• Macleans Primary School\r\n• Howick Intermediate\r\n• Pakuranga College\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family, first-home buyer, professional couple, or investor. Looking to buy a property is a premium location with great value. Here is the one for you!",
